---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="About Me | Morad Abaz" 
  description="About Morad Abaz - Software Engineer from Murcia, Spain, writing about computer science, data science, LLMs, and programming."
>
  <div class="container page-container">
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-main">
        <div class="badge badge-purple" style="margin-bottom: 0.8rem;">Profile</div>
        <h1>About <span class="gradient-text">Morad Abaz</span></h1>
        
        <div class="glass-card about-card prose">
          <p class="lead">
            Hi everyone, my name is <strong>Morad</strong>. I’m a Software Engineer passionate about Computer Science, systems architecture, data engineering, and AI.
          </p>

          <p>
            I studied Computer Science at the <strong>University of Murcia</strong> in Spain and currently work as a Software Engineer. 
            I love discovering new tools in the tech ecosystem, performing personal research in LLMs and Semantic Layers, and sharing what I learn along the way.
          </p>

          <h3>Why Coding & Technical Writing?</h3>
          <p>
            What I love most about programming is the ability to build powerful, world-changing tools from anywhere with just a laptop. 
            Teaching and writing articles is my way of cementing knowledge and giving back to the developer community.
          </p>

          <h3>What I Write About</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Medium Technical Series</strong>: LLMs SQL hallucination benchmarks, Semantic Layer architecture, dbt, Debezium CDC, and stream processing with Flink.</li>
            <li><strong>Data Science & Machine Learning</strong>: Python notebooks, classification algorithms, Pandas, Scikit-Learn, and RStudio models.</li>
            <li><strong>Systems & C Fundamentals</strong>: Low-level C programming, memory management, pointers, and data structures.</li>
          </ul>

          <div class="social-links-box">
            <h4>Connect with me</h4>
            <div class="social-buttons">
              <a href="https://medium.com/@moradabaz" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-secondary">
                Medium (@moradabaz)
              </a>
              <a href="https://github.com/moradisten" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-secondary">
                GitHub (@moradisten)
              </a>
              <a href="https://www.instagram.com/random.coding/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-secondary">
                Instagram (@random.coding)
              </a>
              <a href="mailto:moradabaz@gmail.com" class="btn btn-primary">
                Send Email
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-container {
    padding-top: 4rem;
    padding-bottom: 5rem;
  }

  .about-grid {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  h1 {
    margin-bottom: 1.8rem;
  }

  .about-card {
    padding: 3rem;
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--text-main);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1.6rem;
  }

  .social-links-box {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  }

  .social-links-box h4 {
    margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .social-buttons {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about-card {
      padding: 1.6rem;
    }
  }
</style>
